🟠 api in shop (prod-eu-1) keeps running out of memory. Its node and registry are healthy and unchanged, so nothing outside it points to a cause. It was killed at its 512Mi memory limit; it used 505Mi at peak in the last 24 hours. Its last run lasted two hours; four restarts since its pod was created one hour ago. Fix in: deployment/api → container app → resources.limits.memory (512Mi). To read the output of the last crash, run kubectl logs api-d461a92b-a -c app -n shop --previous
